{"seq":38,"slug":"organizational-design","title":"组织设计","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"组织设计-从结构到能力的系统工程\">组织设计：从结构到能力的系统工程</h1><p>组织设计不是画组织架构图。它是一门将战略意图转化为日常行为的系统工程——决定谁拥有什么决策权、信息如何流动、人才如何配置、激励如何对齐。当你发现团队之间反复出现协调摩擦、决策链路过长、或者明明战略清晰却落地乏力时，往往不是人的问题，而是组织设计出了偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦于<strong>组织的结构性设计</strong>——包括经典理论框架、现代团队拓扑、设计流程工具、以及组织转型方法论。它与相邻 hub 的边界如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>战略管理</strong>（<code>20_strategic-management</code>）：战略决定方向，组织设计决定如何把方向变成执行力。战略是&quot;做什么&quot;，组织设计是&quot;怎么组织人去做&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>变革管理</strong>（<code>21_change-management</code>）：变革管理关注从现状到目标状态的过渡过程和人的心理，组织设计关注目标状态本身应该长什么样。二者是&quot;设计新结构&quot;与&quot;落地新结构&quot;的关系。</li>\n<li><strong>工程管理</strong>（<code>01_engineering-management</code>）：工程管理侧重一线管理者的日常实践（1:1、绩效、招聘），组织设计则在更高层面回答&quot;这些管理者应该如何被组织起来&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>远程异步管理</strong>（<code>25_remote-async-management</code>）：远程是一种工作模式，本 hub 的第四章从组织设计视角讨论分布式组织结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>对于技术管理者（Tech Lead / Engineering Manager）：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>先读第一章「基础理论」建立框架认知（Mintzberg 和 Galbraith 是绕不开的）</li>\n<li>再读第二章「现代模式」了解 Team Topologies 和 Spotify Model 的实践与教训</li>\n<li>第三章「设计实操」在你需要做组织调整时按需查阅</li>\n<li>第四章「组织转型」在面临规模化或远程转型时深读</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>对于创业者或高管：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>从第三章「设计实操」的设计流程入手，建立方法论</li>\n<li>回读第一章的 Galbraith Star Model 理解五维对齐</li>\n<li>第四章帮你规划从当前状态到目标组织的路径</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的管理学常识（知道什么是职能制、事业部制、矩阵制）</li>\n<li>对软件工程团队的日常运作有体感（敏捷、Scrum 等基本概念）</li>\n<li>建议先阅读「战略管理」hub 中关于战略与组织对齐的内容</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"组织设计基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"org-design-fundamentals","title":"组织设计基础与 Mintzberg 五种构型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/foundations/org-design-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coordination-mechanisms","title":"协调机制与设计参数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/foundations/coordination-mechanisms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"galbraith-star-model","title":"Galbraith 星型模型：五维对齐的设计框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/foundations/galbraith-star-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern","title":"现代组织模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/modern","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-topologies","title":"Team Topologies：面向快速流动的团队设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/modern/team-topologies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spotify-model","title":"Spotify Model 与组织模式反思","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/modern/spotify-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-organizations","title":"平台型组织与网络化结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/modern/platform-organizations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"design","title":"设计实操","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-process","title":"组织设计流程：从战略解码到结构落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/design/design-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"role-design-and-spans","title":"角色设计与管理幅度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/design/role-design-and-spans"},{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-rights","title":"决策权与治理结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/design/decision-rights"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"transformation","title":"组织转型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"org-transformation-planning","title":"组织转型规划：从现状到目标的安全路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/transformation/org-transformation-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scaling-organizations","title":"规模化组织设计：从团队到团队的团队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/transformation/scaling-organizations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hybrid-remote-design","title":"分布式与混合办公组织设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/organizational-design/transformation/hybrid-remote-design"}]}]}